{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.916,"lines":[{"text":"Yeah...","t":6.08,"e":6.28,"w":[["Yeah",6.08,6.28]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"The energy is rising.","t":6.38,"e":8.12,"w":[["The",6.38,6.54],["energy",6.6,7.14],["is",7.22,7.34],["rising",7.46,8.12]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Soleil dans le cœur, rage dans les veines.","t":8.86,"e":12.28,"w":[["Soleil",8.86,9.54],["dans",9.6,9.74],["le",9.8,9.92],["cœur",10,10.36],["rage",10.88,11.24],["dans",11.32,11.48],["les",11.54,11.68],["veines",11.74,12.28]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Let’s go.","t":13.66,"e":14.18,"w":[["Let’s",13.66,13.82],["go",13.88,14.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Soleil, sunshine, brille dans ma vie,","t":17.32,"e":20.3,"w":[["Soleil",17.32,18.08],["sunshine",18.2,19.44],["brille",19.58,19.76],["dans",19.8,19.9],["ma",19.94,20.08],["vie",20.14,20.3]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Rage de réussir, je casse tous les bruits.","t":20.9,"e":23.78,"w":[["Rage",20.9,21.1],["de",21.5,21.7],["réussir",22.1,22.3],["je",22.7,22.8],["casse",23.06,23.22],["tous",23.26,23.38],["les",23.42,23.54],["bruits",23.6,23.78]],"ok":0.62},{"text":"God is my witness, I’m winning the race,","t":24.02,"e":27.44,"w":[["God",24.02,24.22],["is",24.3,24.42],["my",24.46,24.62],["witness",24.74,25.94],["I’m",26.2,26.34],["winning",26.5,26.82],["the",26.86,26.94],["race",27.04,27.44]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Dancing to the rhythm, I set the pace.","t":27.7,"e":30.86,"w":[["Dancing",27.7,28.06],["to",28.16,28.38],["the",28.58,28.7],["rhythm",28.8,29.38],["I",29.5,29.52],["set",30.14,30.26],["the",30.3,30.4],["pace",30.5,30.86]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Soleil, sunshine, brille dans ma vie,","t":31.38,"e":34.1,"w":[["Soleil",31.38,31.94],["sunshine",32.02,33.36],["brille",33.4,33.58],["dans",33.62,33.72],["ma",33.78,33.92],["vie",33.96,34.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Rage de réussir, je casse tous les bruits.","t":34.71,"e":38.02,"w":[["Rage",34.71,34.91],["de",35.32,35.52],["réussir",35.93,36.13],["je",36.54,36.62],["casse",36.86,37.02],["tous",37.08,37.18],["les",37.24,37.3